# What no image build reads. Every Dockerfile in this repository builds from
# the root context; the images install their own dependencies from the
# lockfile and build their own artifacts, so nothing installed or built on the
# host may ride along - a host node_modules alone is gigabytes and the wrong
# platform's binaries.
